   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking someone's name",
     "texto": [
      "**Cum te cheamă?** is used with «you» (informal); **Cum vă numiți?** is the polite form, equivalent to «what is your name?» (polite). With **dumneavoastră**, the verb is in the plural, even when you are speaking to just one person."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "First name and surname",
     "texto": [
      "**Mă cheamă Elena** means «my name is Elena». Word for word it is «they call me», but that literal translation does not sound natural in English. **Prenume** is the first name; **nume**, the surname in this context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
